      "value": "@{5f316ea23621ce4fdf77ca93|full_name}: These points are very much vaild and I appreciate your input on this. This is definitely something that has slipped by in this suggestion. Given the nature of VRC was to be a social platforms to let people find friends and such, this system would create a high gate/barrier for people to befriend each other. \nBut I would also like to think this is where the trusted rank system would be a great help. Much like to the current safety settings, this system can be toggled off for certain ranks of users to lower the barriers between users and the social aspects. The one of the biggest purpose on this system is to significantly reduce the possiblities of avatar rippers and theives in VRChat. And to my experience, large ratio of these rippers are either below the rank of trusted users (orange). \nNow, there is no doubt that the possibilties of a ripper being one of your friend or a high trust rank user, But the numbers of these rippers will be far more less than what we have now. Thats why the report system would still exist. We are aware that it is almost imposible to get rid of ALL avatar creators. But this would help the morderation team to reduce weight and numbers of cases to where if a report was submitted, They will be able to start the investigation in a greater efficiency. \nAgain I really appreciate the thoughts and vaild points given here, this is why this canny post was made and I happy to see people are giving this a piece of their mind.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
