      "value": "I think the developers have said they won't do this because of some social problems they just made up, similar to how Tupper said scaling would create social problems in a what if situation he just made up in his head that doesn't exist.\nWould be really good for safety and would make publics safer for people using custom avatars, as long as the avatar doesn't download on their end even though your safety is enabled to not show for random people.",
